 Chinese characters, partly shadowed and softened by depth of field. Below it, red vertical couplets and smaller red paper decorations mark entrances and doorways, standing out as the only saturated accents against muted stone, gray-blue shade, and amber sun. Red lanterns hang along the storefront line, their circular forms catching warm rim light and repeating down the street.\n\nThe middle ground contains narrow sidewalks, utility poles, tangled overhead cables, shopfronts, metal awnings, baskets, stools, buckets, and small containers clustered naturally at thresholds. Local residents move through the space in everyday states: some stand near doorways, some walk away from the camera, and others gather in partial shadow. Their clothing is practical and subdued, including dark jackets, patterned shirts, trousers, and simple shoes. The figures are not arranged for the camera; their gestures are interrupted, casual, and observational.\n\nOn the right side, the alley recedes into bright late-afternoon glare, with hard sunlight cutting across pavement and façades. The road surface is uneven, dusty"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 710, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 484, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [270, 290.0001220703125], "pos": [1848.865966796875, 2310.12353515625], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "im